      "source": "Uses a <a href=\"StompEncoder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>StompEncoder</code></a> to encode a message and splits it into parts no\nlarger than the configured\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp.StompEncoder,int)\">buffer size limit</a>.",
